LPL combiRCF description

  specification description

    part Vars	of sort list[identifier]
	 	import sigSyntax
    part Ops1   of sort list[pair[identifier,int]]
                import sigSyntax
    part Ops2   of sort list[pair[identifier,int]]
                import sigSyntax
     
  end

  query 	of sort eqSystem
         	result of sort eqSystem
	 	import combiRCF[Vars,Ops1,Ops2] bool eqSystem 
                        combiSystem
			
         	start with (combieqSysstrat) query 


end

